4[(m)

prohibiting unlimited liability or that which would result in encumbrance of the assets vested in the board of trustees, except as approved by the Authority;]

(n)

provision to ensure that removal of a trustee of the National Pension System Trust, in all cases, shall be decided by the Authority;

(o)

provisions specifying the quorum and frequency of the meetings of the Board of Trustees;

